{"kind":"artifact","text":"World-basis marks, unmerged on branch task/world-basis at 55595cb364b423430d3b87e95870243e1e2b83d5. Implements the ratified convention this rests on.\n\nThe fold separates the two kinds of staleness it could already see. staleness returns transitive staleness plus a narrowing map: a record is world-stale when the retired basis that made it stale is itself an artifact, or when it rests on something already world-stale, so the distinction survives any number of hops. Statement and Artifact carry it as describes_superseded_world. Artifact also carries unable_to_flare, set when the record cites no basis, and succession_unrecorded, set when the immediately preceding artifact at the identical path string is not retired. The status page renders all three and counts the last two. The kernel is untouched and no admission rule changed.\n\nSix tests, each probed by mutation. Killing the world map, ignoring the artifact kind in the world test, and inverting the succession predicate each fail a test that named the behaviour; killing unable_to_flare fails two. The negative case uses the existing golden fixture, where an artifact goes stale because its governing request died: still stale, and correctly not reported as the world moving. One test pins that the succession warning appears while the predecessor is live and clears once it is superseded, so the mark behaves as a to-do rather than a permanent scold.\n\nTwo limits I did not close, stated rather than left to be found. Paths compare as exact strings, so an artifact recorded at a comma-joined path does not warn about a predecessor recorded at one of its members; this artifact is itself such a case. And the reference documentation does not yet describe the three marks, which belongs to the documentation set request rather than here.\n\nGates on the exact head: gofmt clean for every file this branch touches, go vet clean, and the full go test suite passing. gofmt reports spike/internal/nexus/session_privacy_test.go as unformatted; that is pre-existing on main, untouched by this branch, and left alone deliberately.","body":{"branch":"task/world-basis","commit":"55595cb364b423430d3b87e95870243e1e2b83d5","head":"55595cb364b423430d3b87e95870243e1e2b83d5","path":"spike/internal/workroom,SKILL.md,AGENTS.md"}}